project (k, s) (rows≈3 cost≈15.8K)
└─ project (b.k, b.s) (rows≈3 cost≈15.7K)
   └─ filter (! (call qdb_is_null k)) (rows≈3 cost≈15.6K)
      └─ project (k, s) (rows≈7 cost≈15.5K)
         └─ project (a.k, a.s) (rows≈7 cost≈15.3K)
            └─ filter (! (call qdb_string_view_sql_like s (cast "%o%" <named StringView>))) (rows≈7 cost≈15.1K)
               └─ project (k, s) (rows≈15 cost≈14.8K)
                  └─ filter (call qdb_string_view_sql_like |r.s| (cast "a%" <named StringView>)) (rows≈15 cost≈14.4K)
                     └─ source r AS r row-groups (call qdb_string_view_sql_like |r.s| (cast "a%" <named StringView>)) (rows≈300 cost≈7.2K)
